{"seq":2,"slug":"carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms","title":"承运人费率表、免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms","wordCount":2853,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"承运人费率表-免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模\">承运人费率表、免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模</h1><p>同一个 40 尺高箱，在洛杉矶港停留 4 天是零费用，停留 9 天可能产生一笔四位数的账单，而停留 20 天时日均费率还会再翻一倍——决定这几百美元还是几千美元差异的，不是单一价格，而是三样东西叠加：<strong>免费期给了多少天</strong>、<strong>每停一天按哪个阶梯计价</strong>、以及<strong>这个费率表在提箱当天是否已经改版</strong>。把这三件事写进代码，等于把一份几十页的承运人 tariff（运价本）翻译成一个可试算、可对账、可追溯版本的数据结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-滞期费与滞箱费是两条独立计时轨\">核心概念：滞期费与滞箱费是两条独立计时轨</h2><p>行业口语把 demurrage 和 detention 连读成「D&amp;D」，但在计费契约里它们是两条<strong>计时起点不同、计费对象不同</strong>的轨道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>滞期费（Demurrage）</strong>：集装箱在<strong>码头或堆场内</strong>超期滞留产生的费用，计费对象是「箱在港的时间」。时钟起点通常从船舶卸货、箱子被置于可提状态（availability / discharge）开始。</li>\n<li><strong>滞箱费（Detention）</strong>：箱子<strong>提离码头之后</strong>超出约定用箱期未归还产生的费用，计费对象是「箱在外的时间」。进口场景从提箱（pickup / gate-out）起算，出口场景从装货后未按时还箱起算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>承运人在其公开运价本里分别对两者设定免费期与费率，美国航线还受联邦海事委员会（FMC）规则约束。两者的边界是<strong>物理位置的转移</strong>：箱子过闸口（gate）那一刻，计时轨从 demurrage 切换到 detention。工程上这意味着「闸口事件」是整个计费系统的核心分片键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>滞期费 Demurrage</th>\n<th>滞箱费 Detention</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计费对象</td>\n<td>箱在码头/堆场的滞留天数</td>\n<td>箱在码头外的占用天数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起点事件</td>\n<td>卸货 / 置为可提</td>\n<td>提箱（gate-out）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终点事件</td>\n<td>提箱（gate-out）</td>\n<td>还箱（empty return）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要责任方</td>\n<td>收货人 / 报关行（清关慢）</td>\n<td>收货人 / 拖车公司（周转慢）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见免费期</td>\n<td>进口 3–5 天（按港口与承运人）</td>\n<td>进口 3–7 天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[船舶卸货] --&gt; B[箱子置为可提]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Demurrage 时钟起算]&#10;  C --&gt; D{免费期耗尽?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[零费用]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[按阶梯累计滞期费]&#10;  F --&gt; G[提箱 gate-out]&#10;  G --&gt; H[Demurrage 时钟停止]&#10;  G --&gt; I[Detention 时钟起算]&#10;  I --&gt; J{用箱期耗尽?}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[零费用]&#10;  J --&gt;|是| L[按阶梯累计滞箱费]&#10;  L --&gt; M[还空箱 empty return]&#10;  M --&gt; N[Detention 时钟停止]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  K --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[船舶卸货] --&gt; B[箱子置为可提]\n  B --&gt; C[Demurrage 时钟起算]\n  C --&gt; D{免费期耗尽?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[零费用]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[按阶梯累计滞期费]\n  F --&gt; G[提箱 gate-out]\n  G --&gt; H[Demurrage 时钟停止]\n  G --&gt; I[Detention 时钟起算]\n  I --&gt; J{用箱期耗尽?}\n  J --&gt;|否| K[零费用]\n  J --&gt;|是| L[按阶梯累计滞箱费]\n  L --&gt; M[还空箱 empty return]\n  M --&gt; N[Detention 时钟停止]\n  E --&gt; G\n  K --&gt; M</pre><p>图中两个 <code>D</code>/<code>J</code> 菱形就是费率表发挥作用的位置：<strong>免费期决定是否进入计费分支，阶梯费率决定进入后累计多少</strong>。把这两者硬编码成一个 <code>daily_rate</code> 浮点数，会在合同改版、设备类型分化、港口差异出现时立刻失效——所以它们必须是可分版本的数据契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"免费期条款的时钟起点与适用口径\">免费期条款的时钟起点与适用口径</h2><p>「免费期几天」听起来像配置项，实际是一个带起算规则与暂停规则的<strong>计时函数</strong>。同一个承运人写的 5 天免费期，在实务中至少有三处口径分歧会改变账单金额：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>起算基准</strong>：多数航线以「箱子置为可提」（availability notice / discharge）起算，但出口 detention 以「提空箱」起算，个别航线以「船舶到港 ATA」起算。DCSA（Digital Container Shipping Association）发布的 Port Call Data Definitions 定义了 <code>ATA</code>、<code>ATB</code>、<code>ATC</code>、<code>ATD</code> 等靠港时间戳，正是为了让双方对「起点」有同一套机器可读的事件命名。</li>\n<li><strong>日历日还是工作日</strong>：多数承运人按<strong>日历日</strong>（calendar days）计，但部分港口合同按<strong>工作日</strong>（working days）计，周六日与法定假日不计入免费期也不计费。这要求计时函数携带一份「港口营业日历」。</li>\n<li><strong>暂停事件</strong>：美国 FMC 在 2020 年发布的 Interpretive Rule on Demurrage and Detention（46 CFR Part 545）确立了「激励原则（incentive principle）」——收费的目的是促使货物流转，若货物<strong>无法被提走</strong>（码头未放箱、清关卡住、承运人自身原因导致不可提），相关时段不应计费。这被业界称为「availability of cargo」抗辩，工程上表现为免费期计时可被「暂停（suspension）」事件打断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>计费天数因此不是简单的日期相减，而是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>billable</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>suspended</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{billable}} = \\max\\bigl(d_{\\text{elapsed}} - f - d_{\\text{suspended}},\\, 0\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">billable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">suspended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{elapsed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按日历口径统计的已流逝天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是合同免费期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>suspended</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{suspended}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">suspended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被合规抗辩豁免的天数。三个量都必须留痕，否则对账时无法解释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>billable</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{billable}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">billable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的由来。这三类事件的采集与时间线建模，可对照 <a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\">D&amp;D 时钟模型与集装箱事件时间线</a> 展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承运人费率表的结构-阶梯-设备类型与生效期\">承运人费率表的结构：阶梯、设备类型与生效期</h2><p>承运人公开运价本（tariff）里的 D&amp;D 费率几乎从不是单一价格，而是一张<strong>多维适用矩阵</strong>。真正决定金额的维度至少有五个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>对费率的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设备类型</td>\n<td>20GP、40GP、40HC、40RF（冷藏）</td>\n<td>冷藏箱费率常为普箱数倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯区间</td>\n<td>Day 1–4 / Day 5–10 / Day 11+</td>\n<td>越往后单价越高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>港口 / 目的地</td>\n<td>上海 → 洛杉矶 vs 上海 → 汉堡</td>\n<td>各港拥堵程度不同，费率不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口 / 出口</td>\n<td>import vs export</td>\n<td>免费期与费率分别设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生效期</td>\n<td>版本号 + 生效日</td>\n<td>改版后新账单走新费率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶梯结构是这份契约的核心。以一条<strong>说明性</strong>结构为例（真实数值以各承运人当期运价本为准）：某航线 40HC 进口滞期费可写作「免费期 4 天；第 5–9 天每天 150 美元；第 10–14 天每天 250 美元；第 15 天起每天 400 美元」。这里的关键是「每天 400 美元」只对<strong>超出的那一天</strong>生效，不是把整段重算为 400——这是阶梯计费与「统一提价」最容易被实现错的地方。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[输入: 滞期天数 d 与设备类型] --&gt; B{d ≤ 免费期 f?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| Z[费用 = 0]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[定位生效版本: tariff_version]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按设备类型筛选费率行]&#10;  D --&gt; E[按港口/进出口筛选适用区间]&#10;  E --&gt; F[遍历阶梯括号累加]&#10;  F --&gt; G[输出明细: 每段天数 × 单价]&#10;  G --&gt; H[写入发票行项目]\">graph TD\n  A[输入: 滞期天数 d 与设备类型] --&gt; B{d ≤ 免费期 f?}\n  B --&gt;|是| Z[费用 = 0]\n  B --&gt;|否| C[定位生效版本: tariff_version]\n  C --&gt; D[按设备类型筛选费率行]\n  D --&gt; E[按港口/进出口筛选适用区间]\n  E --&gt; F[遍历阶梯括号累加]\n  F --&gt; G[输出明细: 每段天数 × 单价]\n  G --&gt; H[写入发票行项目]</pre><p>图中 <code>tariff_version</code> 那一步是整个系统可靠性的分水岭：<strong>账单必须按「费用发生日」的版本计费，而不是按「开票日」的版本</strong>。一份 5 月发生的滞期费，若 6 月费率改版，仍须用 5 月版本重算——这要求费率表是<strong>时间维度的慢变表（slowly changing dimension）</strong>，而不是一张随时被覆盖的配置表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶梯计费契约建模-值类型-括号与版本化\">阶梯计费契约建模：值类型、括号与版本化</h2><p>把上述结构落成代码，第一件事是把「钱」和「天数」从裸 <code>float</code> 提升为值类型，避免美元与人民币、日历日与工作日混算。核心是<strong>分段线性阶梯</strong>：给定括号边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 = b_0 &lt; b_1 &lt; \\dots &lt; b_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与各段单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, \\dots, r_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，累计金额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(d) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} r_i \\cdot \\Bigl(\\min(d,\\, b_i) - \\min(d,\\, b_{i-1})\\Bigr)^{+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9613em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3112em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\cdot)^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示取非负部分，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(\\cdot, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个公式的两个性质正是契约要表达的意图：<strong>单调不减</strong>（停得越久越贵）与<strong>分段斜率递增</strong>（越往后边际单价越高，形成「尽快提箱」的激励）。免费期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 只是把有效天数替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d - f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，不改变阶梯本身。</p>\n<p>一个可运行的 Python 实现把所有维度收敛到一个函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;from datetime import date&#10;from decimal import Decimal&#10;&#10;@dataclass(frozen=True)&#10;class Tier:&#10;    upper_day: int&#10;    rate: Decimal&#10;&#10;@dataclass(frozen=True)&#10;class TariffRule:&#10;    carrier: str&#10;    port: str&#10;    direction: str&#10;    equipment: str&#10;    free_days: int&#10;    tiers: tuple&#10;    effective_from: date&#10;    version: str&#10;&#10;def tiered_charge(billable_days: int, rule: TariffRule) -&gt; Decimal:&#10;    total, prev = Decimal(&quot;0&quot;), 0&#10;    for t in rule.tiers:&#10;        span = max(0, min(billable_days, t.upper_day) - prev)&#10;        total += span * t.rate&#10;        prev = t.upper_day&#10;        if billable_days &lt;= t.upper_day:&#10;            break&#10;    return total\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decimal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decimal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frozen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    upper_day: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rate: Decimal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frozen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TariffRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carrier: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    port: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    direction: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    equipment: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    free_days: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tiers: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tuple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    effective_from: date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    version: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tiered_charge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billable_days: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rule: TariffRule) -> Decimal:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total, prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decimal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule.tiers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billable_days, t.upper_day) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.upper_day</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> billable_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.upper_day:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span></code></pre></div><p>契约建模的几条硬约束，直接来自上述结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>金额用 <code>Decimal</code>，不用 <code>float</code></strong>。滞期费要逐笔对账，二进制浮点会在累加时产生分位误差，导致与承运人发票差几分钱而无法核销。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>费率行必须带 <code>effective_from</code>，查找时用「发生日落在哪个版本区间」</strong>。同一承运人、同一港口、同一设备类型，会有多行不同生效期的记录，查询函数是 <code>find_rule(occurred_on) → rule</code>，而非 <code>get_rule()</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>阶梯括号必须覆盖到开区间</strong>，最后一段 <code>upper_day</code> 用一个哨兵值（如 <code>999999</code>）表示「及以上」，否则超出最后一档会漏算。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>免费期与阶梯分离</strong>：免费期是合同时长，阶梯是价格；两者任一改版都要生成新版本，不能就地修改旧版本（旧版本仍可能被历史账单引用）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>设备类型缺失时的兜底</strong>：承运人运价本对特殊箱（冷藏、开顶、框架箱）常设「未列明即适用普箱费率」条款，查找函数要显式实现「精确匹配 → 品类兜底 → 通用兜底」的三级回退，而非抛异常中断计费。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"账单发票的合规字段与争议时钟\">账单发票的合规字段与争议时钟</h2><p>在美国航线，承运人开出的 D&amp;D 发票不是自由格式，而受 <strong>2022 年《海运改革法案》（Ocean Shipping Reform Act of 2022，Public Law 117-146）</strong> 与 FMC 据此制定的<strong>滞期滞箱计费规则（46 CFR Part 541）<strong>约束。该规则（2024 年生效）对契约建模提出了直接的数据要求：发票必须</strong>逐项列明</strong>、必须能定位到具体集装箱与提单、必须在费用停止累计后的<strong>法定期限内</strong>开具，并给出<strong>争议窗口</strong>。这意味着计费系统的输出端不是一张汇总单，而是一组<strong>发票行项目</strong>，每一行都要能反查到：集装箱号（按 ISO 6346 / BIC 编码规则校验）、提单号（B/L）、计费时段、适用的费率表版本、以及每小时段对应的单价。</p>\n<p>工程上把这些落成验收清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发票行必须携带「集装箱号 + 提单号 + 计费起止日期 + 天数 + 单价 + 金额 + 费率表版本号」，缺一即视为不可对账。</li>\n<li>发票必须能从系统反查触发它的<strong>计时事件对</strong>（起算事件与终止事件），以便应对「起算日争议」。</li>\n<li>争议窗口是一个<strong>独立的时钟</strong>：从发票开具日起算的固定天数内，收货人可提出异议并暂停付款义务；系统需单独追踪这个状态，而不能把它和计费时钟混为一谈。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[费用停止累计] --&gt; B{在法定期限内开票?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[承运人丧失收费权]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[生成逐项发票]&#10;  D --&gt; E[收货人收到发票]&#10;  E --&gt; F{争议窗口内提出异议?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[进入正常付款流程]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[争议时钟暂停付款义务]&#10;  H --&gt; I[承运人复核]&#10;  I --&gt; J{费用成立?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| G&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[调整发票行 / 核销]\">graph TD\n  A[费用停止累计] --&gt; B{在法定期限内开票?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[承运人丧失收费权]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[生成逐项发票]\n  D --&gt; E[收货人收到发票]\n  E --&gt; F{争议窗口内提出异议?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[进入正常付款流程]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[争议时钟暂停付款义务]\n  H --&gt; I[承运人复核]\n  I --&gt; J{费用成立?}\n  J --&gt;|是| G\n  J --&gt;|否| K[调整发票行 / 核销]</pre><p>这张流程把「商业责任模型」具象化：<strong>承运人承担按期、按项开票的义务，收货人承担在窗口内主张异议的责任</strong>。任一方错过自己的时钟，结果就不对称——承运人错过开票期限可能丧失收费权，收货人错过争议窗口则丧失抗辩机会。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>两条计时轨</strong>：demurrage 计「箱在港」，detention 计「箱在外」，以闸口事件为分界；建模时是两条独立状态机，不是一张表的两个字段。</li>\n<li><strong>免费期是计时函数</strong>，携带起算基准（ATA / availability / gate-out）、日历口径（日历日 / 工作日）与暂停规则（availability of cargo 抗辩）；可计费天数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>billable</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>suspended</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{billable}} = \\max(d_{\\text{elapsed}} - f - d_{\\text{suspended}}, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">billable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">suspended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>费率表是多维适用矩阵</strong>，至少含设备类型、阶梯区间、港口、进出口方向、生效期五个维度；阶梯用分段线性公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(d) = \\sum_i r_i \\bigl(\\min(d,b_i) - \\min(d,b_{i-1})\\bigr)^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3612em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0112em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 建模。</li>\n<li><strong>版本化是可靠性分水岭</strong>：按「费用发生日」而非「开票日」选版本，费率表是慢变表，改版生成新版本而非就地修改。</li>\n<li><strong>金额用 Decimal、带三级回退查找、发票逐项可反查</strong>，是让账单能被对账、能在 FMC 争议流程中被采信的三条底线。</li>\n<li>主要依据：FMC 46 CFR Part 541（D&amp;D 计费规则）与 46 CFR Part 545（Interpretive Rule）；美国《海运改革法案 2022》（PL 117-146）；DCSA Port Call Data Definitions；ISO 6346 / BIC 集装箱编码标准；以及各承运人当期公开运价本中的 D&amp;D 费率表（数值随版本浮动，须以合同适用版本为准）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承运人费率表、免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模","id":"承运人费率表-免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：滞期费与滞箱费是两条独立计时轨","id":"核心概念-滞期费与滞箱费是两条独立计时轨"},{"level":2,"text":"免费期条款的时钟起点与适用口径","id":"免费期条款的时钟起点与适用口径"},{"level":2,"text":"承运人费率表的结构：阶梯、设备类型与生效期","id":"承运人费率表的结构-阶梯-设备类型与生效期"},{"level":2,"text":"阶梯计费契约建模：值类型、括号与版本化","id":"阶梯计费契约建模-值类型-括号与版本化"},{"level":2,"text":"账单发票的合规字段与争议时钟","id":"账单发票的合规字段与争议时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Demurrage 与 Detention 的定义边界、收费主体与起算口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/demurrage-vs-detention-definition-boundary"},"next":{"title":"费用责任归属与跨主体转嫁（货主/货代/车队/收货人）机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/dd-liability-attribution-chargeback"}}